<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25709" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαρκ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sufficient,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					626a2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.11.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.23
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lasting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠφέλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					3.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πολύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.54
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				24
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i>with staying power,</i> of an athlete, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				6.13.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.146a
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.115
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>Hist.</u>
				p.209D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demoph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἔχειν τι</span> to be
				<i>amply</i> provided with, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1.21
			</span></i>, al.: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαρκέστατα ζῆν</span>”
				<i>in complete competence,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.8.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
